01-config.patch            open a separate Chrome window instead of attaching to a running one;
                           Xiaohongshu search sorted by time
02-douyin-wait-page.patch  wait until Douyin's index page stops reloading before reading it
03-bilibili-qrcode.patch   wait until Bilibili's login dialog has filled in the QR code image
04-search-time-range.patch let Gleaner narrow Douyin, Zhihu and Bilibili searches to recent posts through
                           GLEANER_* environment variables (unset: MediaCrawler's own defaults)
